# Unit16
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit16核心词汇

extraordinary/ɪkˈstrɔːrdneri/非凡的/She has extraordinary talent in music.
extreme/ɪkˈstriːm/极端的/The region experiences extreme weather conditions.
eye/aɪ/眼睛/She has beautiful blue eyes.
face/feɪs/脸；面对/We must face the reality.
facility/fəˈsɪləti/设施/The school has excellent sports facilities.
fact/fækt/事实/Facts speak louder than words.
factor/ˈfæktər/因素/Price is an important factor in buying decisions.
factory/ˈfæktri/工厂/The factory produces electronic products.
fail/feɪl/失败/He failed the driving test twice.
fair/fer/公平的；博览会/The judge made a fair decision.
faith/feɪθ/信仰；信任/She has great faith in her children.
fall/fɔːl/落下；秋天/The leaves fall in autumn.
false/fɔːls/错误的；假的/The statement turned out to be false.
fame/feɪm/名声/She achieved fame as a singer.
familiar/fəˈmɪliər/熟悉的/The place looks very familiar.
family/ˈfæməli/家庭/Family is the most important thing in life.
famous/ˈfeɪməs/著名的/He is a famous scientist.
fan/fæn/风扇；粉丝/She is a big fan of pop music.
fancy/ˈfænsi/想象；花哨的/She wore a fancy dress to the party.
far/fɑːr/远的/The school is not far from here.
fare/fer/票价/Bus fares have increased this year.
farm/fɑːrm/农场/He grew up on a farm.
fast/fæst/快的/The car was going very fast.
fat/fæt/肥胖的；脂肪/Eating too much fat is bad for health.
fate/feɪt/命运/He believed that fate brought them together.
fault/fɔːlt/过错；缺陷/Whose fault is it that the project failed?
favor/ˈfeɪvər/恩惠；赞成/Can you do me a favor?
fear/fɪr/恐惧/She has a fear of heights.
feature/ˈfiːtʃər/特征；特色/The phone has many new features.
federal/ˈfedərəl/联邦的/The federal government made the decision.
fee/fiː/费用/The tuition fee is very high.
feed/fiːd/喂养/She feeds the baby every three hours.
feel/fiːl/感觉/I feel happy today.
fellow/ˈfeloʊ/同伴；家伙/He is a friendly fellow.
female/ˈfiːmeɪl/女性的/Female workers make up half of the workforce.
fence/fens/围栏/They built a fence around the garden.
festival/ˈfestɪvl/节日/The Spring Festival is the most important holiday in China.
fetch/fetʃ/取来/Can you fetch me a glass of water?
fever/ˈfiːvər/发烧/The child has a high fever.
few/fjuː/很少的/Few people attended the meeting.
field/fiːld/田野；领域/He works in the field of medicine.
fight/faɪt/打架；战斗/The two boys got into a fight.
figure/ˈfɪɡjər/数字；人物/She is an important figure in the field.
file/faɪl/文件；档案/Please save the file on your computer.
fill/fɪl/填满/She filled the glass with water.
film/fɪlm/电影；胶片/They watched a film at the cinema.
final/ˈfaɪnl/最终的/This is the final decision.
finance/ˈfaɪnæns/财政；金融/She works in the finance department.
find/faɪnd/找到/I found my keys under the table.
fine/faɪn/好的；罚款/Everything is fine, thank you.
